# Resources/Prototypes/_KS14/Perks/perks.yml, and their alerts in Resources/Prototypes/_KS14/Alerts/perks.yml
ks-perk-damage-name = Damage
ks-perk-damage-desc = Hits harder and keeps the pressure on.
    Every hit on a living enemy adds damage until you reload, run dry or drop the gun. Point-blank shots hit harder and long shots softer. The magazine drops out with a beep when empty, and the last rounds of a full magazine explode.
ks-perk-tank-name = Tank
ks-perk-tank-desc = Takes the punishment so the others don't have to.
    Injects a combat cocktail on going critical, on a cooldown. Can raise a living shield that soaks damage, and draw the enemy's fire. Better armour waits in the gear vendor.
ks-perk-healing-name = Healing
ks-perk-healing-desc = Keeps themselves and everyone around them on their feet.
    Medicine works faster, health shows at a glance, wounds don't bleed, and hurting the enemy heals you. A combat medibot follows and patches up friends, and the medical beamgun heals a friend in sight from afar.
ks-perk-support-name = Support
ks-perk-support-desc = Keeps the squad supplied and fighting harder together.
    Kills sometimes drop a glowing resupply that fills the magazine of whichever friend walks over it. A turret rides on your shoulder and shoots at the enemy. Rally the squad around you to move, fire and hit harder for a while, and mark an enemy for everyone to see and hit harder.
